@claude Please resolve HARD-1 from the independent review.

`src/components/audit-execution/engagement-header.tsx` — `handleTransition` types `targetStatus` as `EngagementStatus` (includes `PLANNED`). `transitionEngagementStatus` only accepts the action target union (`TEAM_ASSIGNED | OPENING_MEETING | IN_PROGRESS | EXIT_MEETING | REPORT_DRAFT | COMPLETED | CANCELLED`). `pnpm exec tsc --noEmit` fails.

Narrow the argument to the action input type (or `AvailableEngagementTransition["to"]` excluding source-only statuses). Then mark the PR ready for review. Do not merge — NC merges.
